		"description": {
			"public": "<p><strong>Damage:</strong> 1d10+STR Piercing</p><p><strong>Properties:</strong> Natural weapon</p><hr><p><em>Lycan Fury (Path of the Lycan): while you Rage you shift into a monstrous hybrid form. You cannot wield weapons, but you gain natural weapons you’re proficient with: a Bite, 1d10+STR, and Claws, 1d8+STR.</em></p><hr><p><em>[A] Granted by Lycan Fury. Apex Lycan (level 15) gives it 1 additional damage die (2d10+STR). Fury Dice ride it like any melee weapon attack. Attacking with it while neither Raging nor in Beast Form only posts a reminder — it is never blocked.</em></p><p><em>[M] It takes no inventory slot. Talk with your GM to reflavour it (tail, horns…) — the dice stay the same.</em></p>",
